  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 4.  UKRAINIAN LAW AND LIBERTY CIRCLE Public Organization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project tasks are:
1. To strengthen a culture of academic integrity in Ukrainian higher education by addressing widespread issues 
such as plagiarism, cheating, data falsification, and other breaches of academic integrity.
2. To develop the knowledge and leadership capacity of students and young leaders by equipping them with 
practical skills to apply and promote integrity in academic, professional, and civic settings.</narrative>
  </description>
